Raspberry Pi Information:

Raspberry Pi 1 -> Model 4B 4GB RAM with 32gb sd card [used for collecting Arduino Temp and hosting own Graphana website]
Raspberry Pi 2 -> Model 4B 4GB RAM with 64gb sd card [nothing]
Raspberry Pi 3 -> Model 4B 8GB RAM with 128gb sd card [nothing]

OS: Raspberry Pi OS (64-bit), Desktop version (same for all)
All Pi's have static IPs set and have SSH access.

All PI's will be moved from vlan 10 to vlan 20(access for only servers) 



Future Cluster Plans:

The cluster will be 2 worker nodes and 1 control node.

Currently doing reserach on which kubernetes service to run. The plan is to move the arduino plus self hosted Graphana 
inside the cluster. I will try out other services like Jellyfin, Pi-hole and some testing use cases.

I will be using GIT pages to write down my review and journey.




